        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tex Beneke, Henry Mancini, Eydie Gorme, Ronnie Deauville\n- Roles: saxophonists, singers, bandleaders, composers, conductors, arrangers\n- Topics: film scores, television scores, music careers\n\nFacts:\n- Tex Beneke was born on February 12, 1914, and he was an American saxophonist, singer, and bandleader.\n- Henry Mancini was born on April 16, 1924, and he was an American composer, conductor, and arranger.\n- Tex Beneke's band was associated with the careers of Eydie Gorme, Henry Mancini, and Ronnie Deauville.\n- Henry Mancini was best remembered for his film and television scores.\n- Henry Mancini died on June 14, 1994.\n- Tex Beneke died on May 30, 2000.",
